-- stability composes: a fact stable for a system whose own fact is stable for a third is stable for the
-- third. A fold recorded by the solvent, and the solvent's state recorded by an apparatus, is a fold the
-- apparatus records — the chain of decoherence carries the fact outward intact.
stable-compose : (H : Type 0) → (o1 : Observer H) → (o2 : Observer H) → (o3 : Observer H) → StableFor H o1 o2 → StableFor H o2 o3 → StableFor H o1 o3
stable-compose H o1 o2 o3 s t = ((λ y → fst s (fst t y)) , (λ h → concat (cong (fst s) (snd t h)) (snd s h)))
